{
  "info": {
    "name": "Childcare SaaS - Full Platform (Modules 1-3)",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Modules 1-3 of the Childcare SaaS Platform.\n\n**Modules:**\n- Module 1: Organisation / Centre / Room Management\n- Module 2: Authentication / Users / RBAC\n- Module 3: Child / Family Management\n\n**Base URL:** `{{baseUrl}}`\n\n**Authentication:**\nAll protected endpoints require a Bearer token in the Authorization header.\n1. Use the `Login` request under Authentication to obtain an access token.\n2. The collection pre-request script automatically sets the `Authorization` header.\n\n**Test Accounts:**\n- SUPER_ADMIN: `admin@penguinpeak.com` / `Admin12345678!`\n- ORG_ADMIN: `orgadmin@example.com` / `password`\n- EDUCATOR: `educator@example.com` / `password`\n- PARENT: `parent@example.com` / `password`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
